<div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
      		
	<p n="1-2">
		Fourteenth year of Ciṅkaviṇṇaparumaṉ.<note>Sanskrit Siṁhaviṣṇuvarman.</note>
	</p>
	
	<p n="3-7">
		<supplied reason="subaudible">This is the</supplied> stone <supplied reason="subaudible">erected when</supplied> Pāvaṉ of Vaṇṇa-Ūr<note>That is, Vaṇṇaiyūr.</note>, the servant of Cāttaparāva<unclear>ṉā</unclear>r, a relative of Perumpāṇṇaraicar<note>That is, Perumpāṇaraiyar.</note>, died in a fight <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>pūcal-uḷ</foreign></supplied>.
	</p>
	
</div>
      	
